{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a simple 2D platform action game with rogue-lite elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play in a room. You can clear the game by avoiding enemies swarming around you and surviving for 5 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297030/extras/screen.png?t=1741282436\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At first you may find it difficult to choose a skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297030/extras/screen5.png?t=1741282436\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you find it difficult to complete the game, I recommend you shut down the game and take a rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will discover something new every time you start the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I believe you will recognize the true identity of this room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First clear!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3297030/aee36993774897b5f443eace728df847eb4f6e3c.jpg"},{"name":"Half cleared!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3297030/1b94096dd61cf505d3f93cfb1ad4896e7dad870a.jpg"},{"name":"All cleared!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3297030/fd6cca51cadf035dcc57f59c9a9e9dc27f8a51bb.jpg"},{"name":"Outside","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3297030/293c8e2048a850a6973009ac2d3d80c375238367.jpg"},{"name":"I got the hang of it.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3297030/7507e4e964646646d9a8338081b59073c965efcb.jpg"},{"name":"I had everything under control.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3297030/cc140faba820482c0e53364310c96ee45135c41